## STORY_FRAME criteria
- source_precedence: current author-direction and latest Amaia/rooftop correction supersede older comic guidance. Script explicitly permits these editorial cards; prior shot-index cards are unapproved source coverage. Character source tiers are not applicable to these character-free shots.
- identity: not applicable; no people requested or shown.
- style: incomplete: scripted FILM_GRAIN absent on all three navy cards and GATE_WEAVE(0.3) absent on S00-01. build_editorials.py makes uniform backgrounds without either effect; studio-shot specs disable post. Sampled holds visibly remain flat and motionless.
- grade: navy/gold/cream palette matches editorial intent; black cards remain black. No skin pigment involved.
- text: fail exact case on S00-02 English line; title and Spanish wording pass. No unsolicited text.
- anatomy_geometry: stable shared open stroke; no anatomical/contact requirements. No warps.
- crop: pass; sigils and all text contained.
- layers: fail production editability: shot.ecproj compositions contain Footage layers of opaque full-card PNG exposures, not independently usable title, subtitle, sigil and background elements. edit.filmcraft wraps preview.mp4. Editable exposure timing exists, but native editable text/path motion is not present. shared-sigil.svg and Python regeneration help reproducibility but do not supply the requested separated native composition.
- action: draw-on, dissolve, shimmer, exact lengths and black holds present; film treatment missing. No substitute for character animation.
- setting: scripted navy/black editorial fields, no location-specific setting required.
- single_asset: each deliverable is its requested individual shot; review contact sheets are evidence only.

## Targeted repairs
1. New version: add scripted subtle grain to S00-01/S00-02/S02-01 and opening gate weave to S00-01, keeping drawing cadence, durations and black shots intact. Render and inspect endpoints/holds.
2. Preserve mixed case on the English subtitle using caps=False; retain Spanish caps and ABUELA attribution.
3. Deliver separable native background, sigil, title/subtitle and effect layers with editable draw-on/dissolve/shimmer controls. Keep shared path connected and consistent; preserve existing v1 and submit a new version.

No canonical promotion or author approval inferred. Notes, probes, decoded frame samples and QA outputs are confined to this review directory.
